  "node": {
    "id": "ctk:1b2cb31d95e7bd6db4ae967c",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "像倒立摆这样的不稳定系统，只要具备测量输出量的传感器和控制输入，就可以通过反馈实现稳定。对于小车上的倒立摆，测量摆角 θ' 并提供使小车加速的控制输入 u，即可使摆保持直立。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Unstable systems like an inverted pendulum can be stabilized using feedback provided there is a sensor that measures the output quantity and a control input. For the inverted pendulum on a trolley, measuring the pendulum angle θ' and providing a control input u that accelerates the trolley can keep the pendulum upright.",
